stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> packet
  packet: in the packet
  sown: sown
  sprouted: sprouted
  planted: planted out
  flowered: flowered
  podded: in pod
  harvest: picked
  bare: nothing left to pick
  state pick <<choice>>
  packet --> sown: next stage
  sown --> sprouted: next stage
  sprouted --> planted: next stage
  planted --> flowered: next stage
  flowered --> podded: next stage
  planted --> planted: slugs in the night [plants in the bed]
  flowered --> flowered: slugs in the night [plants in the bed]
  podded --> podded: slugs in the night [plants in the bed]
  podded --> pick: next stage
  pick --> harvest: [some plants left]
  pick --> bare: [else]
  harvest --> packet: sow again
  bare --> packet: sow again
